{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074470/extras/d3b0bb1a4914e34286ef705dcba82630.avif?t=1771901083\" width=1200 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Ourlands</i></strong> is a cozy island builder where you handcraft and play around in bespoke little lands and truly explore your creativity. No goals, no management, just vibes. In <strong><i>Ourlands</i></strong>, it's up to you to build cozy and unique little islands free from objectives or restrictions. With dozens of items to discover, your islands can become whatever you need them to be! From chill beachside campfire cookouts to lonely rocky hilltops, items will help you fully explore your creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074470/extras/3e6e69e51693cfd5f627fa44cb64dc19.avif?t=1771901083\" width=1200 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more  you build and play, the more items you'll find to collect! Who knows what you'll stumble upon while poking around the environment. Whether it's variations on the things you've fallen in love with, or brand new things you wouldn't have even expected, there's tons to be surprised and delighted by.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074470/extras/5bb6fd5944ef3017cefc00b3a2bfc498.avif?t=1771901083\" width=1200 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've heard of photo mode. Well, Ourlands has a\u00a0<strong>postcard mode</strong>. Use the postcard mode to capture your favorite creations, decorate them to make your own custom postcards, and share them with the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build cozy islands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock dozens of items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share beautiful creations</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2074470?t=1771901083","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2074470?t=1771901083","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074470/e55ae2a9d98c55e0286d5ebc390a9506d94e519c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771901083","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074470/e55ae2a9d98c55e0286d5ebc390a9506d94e519c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771901083","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4278960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074470/extras/d3b0bb1a4914e34286ef705dcba82630.avif?t=1771901083\" width=1200 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Ourlands</i></strong> is a cozy island builder where you handcraft and play around in bespoke little lands and truly explore your creativity. No goals, no management, just vibes. In <strong><i>Ourlands</i></strong>, it's up to you to build cozy and unique little islands free from objectives or restrictions. With dozens of items to discover, your islands can become whatever you need them to be! From chill beachside campfire cookouts to lonely rocky hilltops, items will help you fully explore your creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074470/extras/3e6e69e51693cfd5f627fa44cb64dc19.avif?t=1771901083\" width=1200 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more  you build and play, the more items you'll find to collect! Who knows what you'll stumble upon while poking around the environment. Whether it's variations on the things you've fallen in love with, or brand new things you wouldn't have even expected, there's tons to be surprised and delighted by.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074470/extras/5bb6fd5944ef3017cefc00b3a2bfc498.avif?t=1771901083\" width=1200 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've heard of photo mode. Well, Ourlands has a\u00a0<strong>postcard mode</strong>. Use the postcard mode to capture your favorite creations, decorate them to make your own custom postcards, and share them with the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build cozy islands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock dozens of items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share beautiful creations</p></li></ul>","developers":["GrahamOfLegend"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074470/307d44f9aaa495